Package: claw-os-agent
Version: __VERSION__
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: __ARCH__
Maintainer: Claw OS <noreply@github.com>
Homepage: https://github.com/xiaoyu-work/claw-os
Depends: bash, coreutils, ca-certificates, bubblewrap, python3, sudo, systemd,
 init-system-helpers (>= 1.52),
 libnss3, libxss1, libasound2, libatk1.0-0, libatk-bridge2.0-0,
 libcups2, libdrm2, libdbus-1-3, libxcomposite1, libxdamage1,
 libxfixes3, libxrandr2, libgbm1, libpango-1.0-0, libcairo2,
