Recommends: chromium | chromium-browser | google-chrome-stable,
 nodejs, python3-pip, git, ripgrep, curl, jq, sqlite3
Suggests: systemd-coredump
Description: reusable Claw OS system agent for Debian and Ubuntu
 Installs the complete headless Claw OS agent stack: `cos`, `clawd`,
 browser and semantic runtimes, capability and approval enforcement,
 audit/session persistence, skills, SDKs, and bundled headless apps.
 .
 The package also installs and enables the privileged `clawd` system
 service. Browser and user indexing services are installed but remain
 opt-in or condition-gated. It does not alter the host's home layout,
 boot identity, desktop environment, PAM policy, or firmware policy.
